+-- rac1.hud.quick_select_draw (Hud_QuickSelectDraw) i32(u32): Draws the quick select ring, each tick it is open (draw_hud_item_selector_panel): ring is its object, the update's.
+type Hud_QuickSelectDrawFn = (ring: number) -> number
+-- rac1.hud.frame (Hud_Frame) void(u32,i32,i32,i32,i32,i32): A HUD icon drawn (hud_frame): element, its frame id (get_icon_frame), x, y, flags, alpha. The quick select ring draws its items' icons through it.
+type Hud_FrameFn = (element: number, id: number, x: number, y: number, flags: number, alpha: number) -> ()
+-- rac1.ui.frame (Ui_Frame) void(i32,i32,i32,i32,i32): Draws a bevelled frame, rows then columns (draw_ui_frame): a message box's is the last the game draws.
+type Ui_FrameFn = (top: number, bottom: number, left: number, right: number, alpha: number) -> ()
+-- rac1.hud.orders_ring_update (Hud_OrdersRingUpdate) void(u32): The ring of 4 orders for Clank's little robots, each tick it is open (update_hud_radial_selector_selection_and_visibility): ring is its object.
+type Hud_OrdersRingUpdateFn = (ring: number) -> ()
+-- rac1.sound.update (Sound_Update) i32(): The sound step of each tick (sound_update): mixes every voice from the camera's eye and rows, which a mod may swap around it.
+type Sound_UpdateFn = () -> number
+-- rac1.weapon.blaster.auto_aim (Blaster_SelectAutoAimTarget) u32(i32,u32,u32,u32): The Blaster's target search outside its first-person aim: the moby it locks on to from a point, turning the yaw and pitch toward it; 0 for none.
